/* Alternating Large-Star / Small-Star, Kiveris et al. (2014).
 * The implementation is a Differential iteration, not recursive DDlog aggregation.
 * Vertex IDs are signed 64-bit integers. Edges are undirected; explicit vertices
 * supplement their endpoints so isolated vertices remain in the result.
 */
extern transformer LargeSmallStar(Vertices: relation['N],
                                 vertex: function(n: 'N): signed<64>,
                                 Edges: relation['E],
                                 from: function(e: 'E): signed<64>,
                                 to: function(e: 'E): signed<64>)
    -> (Labels: relation[(signed<64>, signed<64>)])
